{"seq":3,"slug":"obligation-subject-attribution","title":"责任主体识别与义务分摊实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/endoflife-obligation-subject/obligation-subject-attribution","wordCount":2729,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"责任主体识别与义务分摊实操\">责任主体识别与义务分摊实操</h1><p>一批从深圳发出、经第三方海外仓卖给德国消费者的蓝牙耳机，在 WEEE 语境下可能同时对应五六个&quot;责任人&quot;：品牌方、德国进口商、平台、海外仓运营方、授权代表。但监管只认其中<strong>一个</strong>为&quot;生产者&quot;（Producer），其余是分销商、平台或受托方。把这一个认错，注册号就挂错主体，回收义务与费用分摊全部落空——而这一切发生在货物已经卖出去之后。</p>\n<p>责任主体识别不是法务文书工作，而是<strong>每上一个新市场的准入前置</strong>。它的产物是三条可核验记录：谁注册、注册号是什么、谁按什么权重分摊成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-weee-语境下的-生产者-定义\">核心概念：WEEE 语境下的&quot;生产者&quot;定义</h2><p>欧盟 WEEE 指令 2012/19/EU（2012-08-13 生效，2014-02-14 起适用）把&quot;生产者&quot;限定为三类行为之一：<strong>以自己的品牌制造并销售 EEE</strong>、<strong>以自己的品牌转售他人制造的 EEE</strong>、<strong>将 EEE 进口到某成员国</strong>（<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/waste-and-recycling/waste-electrical-and-electronic-equipment-weee_en\">Directive 2012/19/EU</a>）。注意第三条&quot;进口&quot;——它让跨境卖家的身份从&quot;出口商&quot;瞬间变成目的国的&quot;生产者&quot;。</p>\n<p>对跨境电商，这个定义有三处反直觉：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>品牌不是判据，销售行为的所在地才是。</strong> 白牌贴自己的标卖，你就是品牌生产者；即便你只是品牌授权方，只要以你的品牌在目的国销售，仍可能被认定为生产者。</li>\n<li><strong>一次商品可能产生多个生产者。</strong> 德国进口商是生产者，同时中国品牌方若通过自有德国实体直销，也是生产者——两者需协商谁注册。</li>\n<li><strong>平台可以被拟制为生产者。</strong> 英国 WEEE 法规把&quot;非英国供应商通过距离销售直接向英国终端用户供货&quot;和&quot;把非英国供应商的 EEE 投放英国市场的在线平台运营方&quot;都列为生产者（<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/regulations-waste-electrical-and-electronic-equipment\">GOV.UK WEEE 法规指南</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>判定顺序可以固定成一条决策链，避免每次上新都重新争论。链条的起点是 EPR 制度本身对生产者义务的建模方式，本 hub 的 <a href=\"epr-producer-obligation-model\">EPR 生产者义务模型</a> 先把&quot;义务从哪来&quot;讲清楚，本文接着解决&quot;落到谁头上&quot;：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  SKU[SKU 拟投放目的国] --&gt; Q1{在目的国有&lt;br/&gt;注册实体吗}&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|有| Q2{以自有品牌&lt;br/&gt;销售吗}&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|无| Q3{通过当地进口商&lt;br/&gt;还是直销给终端}&#10;  Q2 --&gt;|是| P1[当地实体 = 生产者]&#10;  Q2 --&gt;|否| Q4{品牌方是谁}&#10;  Q3 --&gt;|经进口商| P2[进口商 = 生产者]&#10;  Q3 --&gt;|距离销售直邮| P3{平台是否代收&lt;br/&gt;并承担责任}&#10;  Q4 --&gt;|自有品牌授权| P4[品牌方 = 生产者&lt;br/&gt;需指定授权代表]&#10;  Q4 --&gt;|他方品牌| P2&#10;  P3 --&gt;|平台承担| P5[平台 = 被拟制生产者]&#10;  P3 --&gt;|卖家自负| P4&#10;  P4 --&gt; REG[取得目的国 WEEE 注册号]&#10;  P1 --&gt; REG&#10;  P2 --&gt; REG&#10;  P5 --&gt; REG&#10;  REG --&gt; OBL[注册 / 报告 / 回收 / 费用分摊]\">graph TD\n  SKU[SKU 拟投放目的国] --&gt; Q1{在目的国有&lt;br/&gt;注册实体吗}\n  Q1 --&gt;|有| Q2{以自有品牌&lt;br/&gt;销售吗}\n  Q1 --&gt;|无| Q3{通过当地进口商&lt;br/&gt;还是直销给终端}\n  Q2 --&gt;|是| P1[当地实体 = 生产者]\n  Q2 --&gt;|否| Q4{品牌方是谁}\n  Q3 --&gt;|经进口商| P2[进口商 = 生产者]\n  Q3 --&gt;|距离销售直邮| P3{平台是否代收&lt;br/&gt;并承担责任}\n  Q4 --&gt;|自有品牌授权| P4[品牌方 = 生产者&lt;br/&gt;需指定授权代表]\n  Q4 --&gt;|他方品牌| P2\n  P3 --&gt;|平台承担| P5[平台 = 被拟制生产者]\n  P3 --&gt;|卖家自负| P4\n  P4 --&gt; REG[取得目的国 WEEE 注册号]\n  P1 --&gt; REG\n  P2 --&gt; REG\n  P5 --&gt; REG\n  REG --&gt; OBL[注册 / 报告 / 回收 / 费用分摊]</pre><p>链条上最容易漏的是最后一跳：<strong>注册号取得 ≠ 义务履行完毕</strong>。注册只解决&quot;身份登记&quot;，报告（销量与重量申报）和回收（回收渠道与达标率）是独立的持续义务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"五类主体与义务映射\">五类主体与义务映射</h2><p>跨境链条上的角色不止&quot;生产者&quot;一个。把每个角色对应到具体义务，才能判断谁该干什么、谁可以委托谁。下表以欧盟 WEEE 与德国 ElektroG、英国 WEEE 法规的共性为准，具体成员国细则仍需单独核对：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主体角色</th>\n<th>典型身份</th>\n<th>核心义务</th>\n<th>可否委托</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生产者 Producer</td>\n<td>品牌方 / 进口商 / 直销卖家</td>\n<td>注册、申报、回收融资、标识</td>\n<td>可委托授权代表办理注册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权代表 Authorised Representative</td>\n<td>目的国境内的受托实体</td>\n<td>代非境内生产者履行注册与申报</td>\n<td>本身不是义务源头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分销商 Distributor</td>\n<td>零售商 / 电商卖家</td>\n<td>同类产品免费回收（like-for-like）、告知义务</td>\n<td>不可转移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在线平台 Marketplace</td>\n<td>交易撮合方</td>\n<td>核验卖家注册号、下架未合规商品</td>\n<td>不可转移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约 / 海外仓 Fulfilment</td>\n<td>3PL、仓储运营方</td>\n<td>通常无 WEEE 义务，但为监管举证提供数据</td>\n<td>不承担生产者义务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终端用户</td>\n<td>消费者</td>\n<td>不得混入生活垃圾、可免费交回</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个实操要点：<strong>授权代表只搬运义务，不消灭义务</strong>——境外生产者仍对申报数据的真实性负责；<strong>平台核验是可被处罚的独立义务</strong>，卖家注册号过期平台不核验，责任在平台（参见德国 stiftung ear 对境外公司的独立注册路径与授权代表安排，<a href=\"https://www.stiftung-ear.de/en\">stiftung ear</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境场景判定-距离销售-平台与授权代表\">跨境场景判定：距离销售、平台与授权代表</h2><p>三种高频跨境模式的责任落点不同，判断时按&quot;货权与销售的连接点&quot;定位：</p>\n<p><strong>模式一，直邮距离销售（D2C）。</strong> 卖家在境外，通过自建站把货直邮给目的国消费者。英国把这类&quot;非英国企业通过距离销售向英国终端用户供货&quot;直接列为生产者，不另设授权代表制度（<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/regulations-waste-electrical-and-electronic-equipment\">GOV.UK</a>）。德国的处理相反：境外公司须在 ear 门户注册，且通常需指定一名境内授权代表（<a href=\"https://www.stiftung-ear.de/en\">stiftung ear</a>）。同一模式在两国责任落点不同——这是&quot;一司多国&quot;卖家最容易踩的坑。</p>\n<p><strong>模式二，平台代销。</strong> 平台可以把未合规卖家下架，也可能被拟制为生产者。英国把&quot;把非英国供应商 EEE 投放英国市场的在线平台运营方&quot;列为生产者；平台上架的卖家若不注册，平台自身承担注册义务。因此平台的核验动作不是客服流程，而是<strong>合规防火墙</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>模式三，进口商买断。</strong> 目的国进口商买断货权再转售，进口商是生产者。此时品牌方（中国）在法律上已退出生产者角色，但仍需向进口商提供 EEE 成分与再处理信息（英国要求生产者投放市场后一年内提供再处理信息，记录保存至少四年）。</p>\n<p>三种模式的责任对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>生产者落点</th>\n<th>注册号归属</th>\n<th>常见风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>D2C 直邮</td>\n<td>境外卖家（或在目的国拟制）</td>\n<td>卖家或授权代表</td>\n<td>目的国差异未识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台代销</td>\n<td>卖家，平台核验 / 可被拟制</td>\n<td>卖家，平台校验</td>\n<td>卖家号失效未拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口商买断</td>\n<td>目的国进口商</td>\n<td>进口商</td>\n<td>品牌方未提供再处理信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判定完成后，识别结果必须落成一条&quot;SKU → 目的国 → 主体 → 注册号&quot;的映射记录，否则每上一个变体都要重走一遍争论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"义务分摊-注册-报告-回收与费用\">义务分摊：注册、报告、回收与费用</h2><p>识别出主体后，剩下三件事：<strong>谁来注册、按什么申报、费用怎么分</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>注册</strong>是身份登记，通常按成员国各自的生产者登记册办理，欧盟层面提供统一的登记与报告格式（<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/waste-and-recycling/waste-electrical-and-electronic-equipment-weee_en\">EC WEEE 页面</a>）。注册号是与监管通信的唯一主键，必须写进商品详情页或随附文件——这正是平台核验的抓取对象。</p>\n<p><strong>申报</strong>是定期上报投放市场的 EEE 数量与重量。重量口径必须<strong>剔除电池</strong>并单独按电池法规申报（英国明确要求排除电池重量、按废电池规则单列），否则申报值与回收体系对不上账。</p>\n<p><strong>费用分摊</strong>是多家主体共存时的核心矛盾。生产者责任组织（PRO）通常按<strong>市场份额权重</strong>分摊集体回收成本，单个生产者的分摊比例可写为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i = \\frac{W_i}{\\sum_{j=1}^{n} W_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4904em;vertical-align:-1.1301em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1301em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个生产者当期投放市场的 EEE 重量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_j W_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该国该类别 EEE 的总投放重量。由此，单个生产者的实际年费为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>collection</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_i = S_i \\times C_{\\text{collection}} \\times (1 + m_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">collection</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>collection</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{collection}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">collection</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该国该类别当年集体回收总成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是生态调节系数（eco-modulation）——可回收设计、易拆解的产品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，难回收的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。这套公式解释了为什么&quot;销量申报准确&quot;直接等于&quot;费用不虚高&quot;：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 报错，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就错，多付或少付都会在年度对账时暴露。</p>\n<p>对一家同时经营多国的跨境卖家，义务台账至少需要四个字段：目的国、注册号、申报周期、费用权重。缺任何一个，年度合规都会在某个国家断档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多辖区并存的实操-责任矩阵与合规日历\">多辖区并存的实操：责任矩阵与合规日历</h2><p>同一款产品在多个市场同时销售时，真正的复杂度不是&quot;识别哪个主体&quot;，而是&quot;多套义务的时序对齐&quot;。EEE 报废合规往往与三条并行监管线交叉：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监管线</th>\n<th>适用对象</th>\n<th>关键时点</th>\n<th>与 WEEE 的交叉点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WEEE 指令（EU 2012/19/EU）</td>\n<td>生产者</td>\n<td>2014-02-14 起适用</td>\n<td>回收渠道与达标率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电池法规（EU 2023/1542）</td>\n<td>电池生产者</td>\n<td>2023-08-17 生效，2024-02-18 起适用，分阶段至 2031</td>\n<td>重量申报剔除电池、单独回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ESPR（EU 2024/1781）</td>\n<td>销毁未售消费品的企业</td>\n<td>2024-07-18 起生效</td>\n<td>未售库存处置记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国 WEEE 法规</td>\n<td>生产者 / 分销商 / 平台</td>\n<td>年度注册</td>\n<td>平台被拟制为生产者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ESPR 值得单独说明：它对未售消费品的销毁设了限制，并要求大企业（其后为中型企业）公布未售消费品的数量、重量与销毁原因（<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/strategy/circular-economy/ecodesign-sustainable-products-regulation_en\">EC ESPR 页面</a>）。这与 WEEE 的交集在于<strong>未售退回库存的处置</strong>——退回来的耳机是重新上架、返修还是报废，直接决定它算不算&quot;投放市场&quot;、要不要计入申报重量。</p>\n<p>跨境的实操建议是把合规做成一张<strong>矩阵而不是清单</strong>：行是 SKU 或产品族，列是目的国，单元格填注册号与申报状态。清单会随市场增加而失效，矩阵不会。</p>\n<p>规模感也需要校准：全球电子废弃物 2022 年为 <strong>6200 万吨</strong>，仅 <strong>22.3%</strong> 被正规收集和回收，2030 年预计达 <strong>8200 万吨</strong>、回收率可能降至 <strong>20%</strong>（<a href=\"https://ewastemonitor.info/the-global-e-waste-monitor-2024/\">Global E-waste Monitor 2024</a>）。监管加码的方向是确定的，责任主体的识别只会更严，不会更松。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>&quot;生产者&quot;由行为定义，不由品牌定义</strong>：以自有品牌销售、贴牌转售、或进口到某成员国，三者居一即为生产者（WEEE 2012/19/EU）。</li>\n<li><strong>平台可被拟制为生产者</strong>——英国把在线平台运营方与非英国距离销售卖家都列为生产者，平台的核验义务是可被处罚的独立义务。</li>\n<li><strong>授权代表只搬运义务、不消灭义务</strong>，境外生产者仍对申报真实性负责。</li>\n<li><strong>同一直邮模式在不同国家责任落点不同</strong>：英国不另设授权代表，德国要求境外公司注册并常需指定境内代表。</li>\n<li><strong>费用按市场份额权重分摊</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i = W_i / \\sum_j W_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再乘生态调节系数；申报重量直接决定钱包。</li>\n<li><strong>电池重量必须从 EEE 申报中剔除</strong>，按 EU 2023/1542 单独走电池回收体系。</li>\n<li><strong>把合规做成矩阵</strong>（SKU × 目的国 → 注册号 / 申报状态），而非一次性清单；未售退货的去向同时牵动 WEEE 与 ESPR。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"责任主体识别与义务分摊实操","id":"责任主体识别与义务分摊实操"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：WEEE 语境下的\"生产者\"定义","id":"核心概念-weee-语境下的-生产者-定义"},{"level":2,"text":"五类主体与义务映射","id":"五类主体与义务映射"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境场景判定：距离销售、平台与授权代表","id":"跨境场景判定-距离销售-平台与授权代表"},{"level":2,"text":"义务分摊：注册、报告、回收与费用","id":"义务分摊-注册-报告-回收与费用"},{"level":2,"text":"多辖区并存的实操：责任矩阵与合规日历","id":"多辖区并存的实操-责任矩阵与合规日历"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"EPR 注册与授权代表机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/endoflife-obligation-subject/epr-registration-authorized-representative"},"next":{"title":"回收渠道与回收点网络模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/waste-collection-network/takeback-channel-network-model"}}